iler": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Off-Road 4x4 Driving & Racing Simulator", "keywords": ["offroaddriving", "mountaindriving", "4x4driving", "jeepracing", "offroadadventure"], "long_description": "Get ready for an exciting off-road adventure in Off-Road 4x4 Driving & Racing Simulator! Drive powerful 4x4 vehicles, explore challenging environments, and test your driving skills across rocky roads, muddy tracks, steep hills, and rugged mountain trails.\n\n\ud83d\ude99 **Exciting Off-Road Driving**\nTake control of powerful 4x4 vehicles and navigate rough terrain, sharp turns, and difficult paths.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 **Thrilling Racing Adventures**\nEnjoy exciting off-road racing, overcome obstacles, and challenge your driving skills on rugged tracks.\n\n\ud83c\udf04 **Explore Rugged Environments**\nDiscover adventurous locations filled with rocky roads, muddy trails, steep slopes, and challenging routes.\n\n\ud83c\udfae **Realistic Driving Experience**\nEnjoy smooth vehicle controls. Accelerate, brake, steer, and improve your off-road driving skills.\n\n\ud83d\udede **Conquer Challenging Terrain**\nClimb steep hills, cross rough roads, and overcome obstacles using careful driving and precise control.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 **Key Features**\n\u2022 Exciting 4x4 off-road driving\n\u2022 Challenging terrain and rugged tracks\n\u2022 Thrilling off-road racing\n\u2022 Steep hills, rocky roads, and muddy trails\n\u2022 Easy and engaging driving controls\n\u2022 Adventurous environments to explore\n\u2022 Fun challenges for off-road enthusiasts\n\nStart your engine, choose your vehicle, and experience the thrill of off-road driving today!", "short_description": "Take on extreme off-road tracks, conquer rugged terrain, and experience thrilling 4x4 driving and racing adventures!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/angelgamestudioprivatelimited/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name":